    "special": {
      "value": "You cannot select another dedication feat until you have gained two other feats from the staff acrobat archetype.\nLeads to: Bullying Staff|EC1, Levering Strike|EC1, Pivot Strike|EC1, Staff Sweep|EC1, Whirlwind Stance|EC1"
